;
    sg140_res75.res created by SHELXL-2014/7

TITL sg140_res75_a.res in I4/mcm
REM Old TITL sg140_res75 in I4/mcm
REM SHELXT solution in I4/mcm
REM R1 0.149, Rweak 0.004, Alpha 0.020, Orientation as input
REM Formula found by SHELXT: Br3 Pb
CELL 0.71073 8.3143 8.3143 11.877 90 90 90
ZERR 4 0.0005 0.0005 0.0009 0 0 0
LATT 2
SYMM -X,-Y,+Z
SYMM -Y,+X,+Z
SYMM +Y,-X,+Z
SYMM -X,+Y,0.5-Z
SYMM +X,-Y,0.5-Z
SYMM +Y,+X,0.5-Z
SYMM -Y,-X,0.5-Z
SFAC Br C N Pb
UNIT 12 4 4 4
EADP N13 C13A
EXYZ N13 C13A

L.S. 25
PLAN  1
TEMP -118
CONF
list 4
fmap 2
acta
MORE -1
